    },
    {
      "id": "protocol-hub",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# \ud83d\udccb LEARNING PROTOCOLS\n## From 9 Frameworks\n\nEvidence-based strategies for\noptimal skill acquisition",
      "x": 4500,
      "y": -1400,
      "width": 377,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "daily-schedule",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Daily Session Template\n\n**MORNING BLOCK (90 min)**\n- 5 min: Review yesterday (retrieval)\n- 60 min: Deep work on new topic\n- 15 min: Active recall practice\n- 10 min: GRINDE mind mapping\n\n**AFTERNOON BLOCK (90 min)**\n- 5 min: Problem selection (4% rule)\n- 60 min: Problem solving (flow zone)\n- 15 min: Solution analysis\n- 10 min: Pattern documentation\n\n**EVENING (30-60 min)**\n- Spaced repetition review\n- Implementation practice\n- Next day planning\n\n**RECOVERY**: NSDR 10-20 min post-learning",
      "x": 4000,
      "y": -800,
      "width": 495,
      "height": 620,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "spaced-rep",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Spaced Repetition Schedule\n\n| Day | Review |\n|-----|--------|\n| Day 1 | Learn new concept |\n| Day 2 | First review (24h) |\n| Day 4 | Second review |\n| Day 7 | Third review |\n| Day 14 | Fourth review |\n| Day 30 | Fifth review |\n| Monthly | Maintenance |\n\n**Effect size**: d = 0.54",
      "x": 4550,
      "y": -800,
      "width": 419,
      "height": 424,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-protocol",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Flow State Protocol\n\n**22 Triggers (Top 5 for coding)**:\n1. Clear goals - Define problem first\n2. Immediate feedback - Run tests\n3. Challenge/skill balance - 4% stretch\n4. Complete concentration - No distractions\n5. Deep embodiment - Standing desk\n\n**Flow Cycle**:\n1. STRUGGLE (20-45 min) - Load the brain\n2. RELEASE (15 min) - Walk away\n3. FLOW (45-90 min) - Peak performance\n4. RECOVERY (30+ min) - Rest required",
      "x": 4000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 467,
      "height": 452,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "huberman-protocol",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Huberman Lab Protocols\n\n**90-min Ultradian Blocks**\n- First 5-10 min = warm-up\n- Middle 60-70 min = peak\n- Natural decline at end\n\n**Gap Effects**\n- Insert 10-sec pauses during practice\n- Brain replays at 20x speed\n- ~1 pause per 2 min of learning\n\n**Post-Learning**\n- Cold exposure spikes adrenaline\n- NSDR accelerates consolidation\n- Caffeine after (not before) learning",
      "x": 4550,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 422,
      "height": 508,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "sleep-protocol",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Sleep Optimization\n\n**Bryan Johnson + Huberman**\n- 8+ hours sleep (7-9 optimal)\n- Consistent bed/wake times\n- First 4 hours most critical\n- Morning light exposure (10-30 min)\n- No screens 60 min before bed\n\n**Memory consolidation during sleep**\n- 20-40% deficit without proper sleep",
      "x": 4000,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 446,
      "height": 368,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "encoding-protocol",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Justin Sung Encoding\n\n**GRINDE Mind Mapping**\n- G: Grouped concepts\n- R: Reflective questioning\n- I: Interconnected nodes\n- N: Non-verbal (symbols)\n- D: Directional flow\n- E: Emphasized key points\n\n**Core Principle**:\nEncoding quality > Retrieval quantity",
      "x": 4550,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 413,
      "height": 396,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "deepwork-protocol",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Cal Newport Deep Work\n\n**4 Philosophies** (pick one):\n1. Monastic - Full isolation\n2. Bimodal - Days for deep/shallow\n3. Rhythmic - Same time daily\n4. Journalistic - Fit it in\n\n**Time Blocking**:\n- Plan every 30-min block\n- Evening planning for next day\n- Shutdown ritual at end\n\n**Formula**:\nOutput = Time \u00d7 Intensity",
      "x": 4000,
      "y": 1100,
      "width": 386,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "colin-protocol",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Colin Galen CP Strategy\n\n**30-40% Success Rule**\nFind problems where you solve\n30-40% without help.\n\n**Black Box Method**:\n1. Use algo without full understanding\n2. Focus on I/O and when to apply\n3. Gradually deepen knowledge\n\n**Upsolving**:\n- Revisit unsolved problems\n- Try 15-30 min fresh\n- Read editorial only after stuck\n- Implement without looking at code",
      "x": 4550,
      "y": 1100,
      "width": 422,
      "height": 508,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "ultralearning-protocol",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Ultralearning 9 Principles\n\n1. **Metalearning** - 10% planning time\n2. **Focus** - Eliminate distractions\n3. **Directness** - Learn by doing\n4. **Drill** - Attack weak points\n5. **Retrieval** - Test yourself\n6. **Feedback** - Get corrective input\n7. **Retention** - Spaced repetition\n8. **Intuition** - Feynman technique\n9. **Experimentation** - Try new methods",
      "x": 4000,
      "y": 1700,
      "width": 476,
      "height": 368,
      "color": "6"
    },
